{
  "Comment": [
    "デプロイ作業をする IAM ユーザ（gate-deployer）に付ける権限。",
    "【重要】ルートアカウントのアクセスキーは使わない。権限が無制限で、絞ることも",
    "取り消しの影響範囲を限定することもできないため（AWS 自身も非推奨としている）。",
    "",
    "AdministratorAccess も使わない。このプロジェクトで触るサービスに絞ってある。",
    "iam の権限は gate-api-role にだけ効くよう Resource で限定した。",
    "他のロールを作ったり、自分の権限を広げたりはできない。",
    "",
    "このコメントは説明用。aws iam create-policy に渡す前に削除すること。",
    "権限が足りずに AccessDenied が出たら、エラー文に不足しているアクション名が",
    "書いてあるので、それをここへ足す。先に広げない。"
  ],
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "DynamoDBForThisProject",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "dynamodb:CreateTable",
        "dynamodb:DescribeTable",
        "dynamodb:DeleteTable",
        "dynamodb:ListTables",
        "dynamodb:UpdateTimeToLive",
        "dynamodb:DescribeTimeToLive",
        "dynamodb:UpdateContinuousBackups",
        "dynamodb:DescribeContinuousBackups",
        "dynamodb:PutItem",
        "dynamodb:GetItem",
        "dynamodb:UpdateItem",
        "dynamodb:Query",
        "dynamodb:Scan"
      ],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:dynamodb:ap-northeast-1:ACCOUNT_ID:table/action_requests",
        "arn:aws:dynamodb:ap-northeast-1:ACCOUNT_ID:table/action_requests/index/*",
        "arn:aws:dynamodb:ap-northeast-1:ACCOUNT_ID:table/request_payloads",
        "arn:aws:dynamodb:ap-northeast-1:ACCOUNT_ID:table/audit_logs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Sid": "ListTablesNeedsWildcard",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "dynamodb:ListTables",
      "Resource": "*"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "LambdaForThisProject",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "lambda:CreateFunction",
        "lambda:UpdateFunctionCode",
        "lambda:UpdateFunctionConfiguration",
        "lambda:GetFunction",
        "lambda:GetFunctionConfiguration",
        "lambda:DeleteFunction",
        "lambda:CreateFunctionUrlConfig",
        "lambda:GetFunctionUrlConfig",
        "lambda:UpdateFunctionUrlConfig",
        "lambda:DeleteFunctionUrlConfig",
        "lambda:AddPermission",
        "lambda:RemovePermission",
        "lambda:GetPolicy",
        "lambda:InvokeFunction",
        "lambda:InvokeFunctionUrl"
      ],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:lambda:ap-northeast-1:ACCOUNT_ID:function:gate-api"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "ListFunctionsNeedsWildcard",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "lambda:ListFunctions",
      "Resource": "*"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "IamOnlyForThisRole",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "iam:CreateRole",
        "iam:DeleteRole",
        "iam:GetRole",
        "iam:PutRolePolicy",
        "iam:GetRolePolicy",
        "iam:DeleteRolePolicy",
        "iam:PassRole"
      ],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:iam::ACCOUNT_ID:role/gate-api-role"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "IamReadOwnUser",
      "Comment3": [
        "自分の権限を確認するためだけの読み取り。実測で足りないと分かった:",
        "  aws iam list-attached-user-policies --user-name gate-deployer",
        "を確認コマンドとして書いていたのに、その権限を入れ忘れていた。",
        "自分自身のユーザにだけ効くよう Resource で限定してある。"
      ],
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["iam:ListAttachedUserPolicies", "iam:GetUser"],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:iam::ACCOUNT_ID:user/gate-deployer"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "IamReadOnlyForVerification",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "iam:ListRoles",
        "iam:SimulatePrincipalPolicy",
        "iam:ListAccessKeys",
        "iam:UpdateAccessKey",
        "iam:DeleteAccessKey"
      ],
      "Resource": "*"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "LogsForThisFunction",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "logs:PutRetentionPolicy",
        "logs:DescribeLogGroups",
        "logs:DeleteLogGroup",
        "logs:GetLogEvents",
        "logs:FilterLogEvents"
      ],
      "Resource": "*"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "BudgetsAndIdentity",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Comment2": [
        "【重要】Budgets の IAM アクションは ViewBudget と ModifyBudget の2つだけ。",
        "CreateBudget / DescribeBudgets という IAM アクションは存在しない。",
        "API 名とIAMアクション名が一致しないサービスがある、という例。",
        "実測で踏んだ: コンソールのポリシーエディタが2件のエラーとして出した。",
        "  aws budgets create-budget    → budgets:ModifyBudget で認可",
        "  aws budgets describe-budgets → budgets:ViewBudget で認可"
      ],
      "Action": ["budgets:ViewBudget", "budgets:ModifyBudget", "sts:GetCallerIdentity"],
      "Resource": "*"
    }
  ]
}
